    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/how_to_play.PNG?t=1706563146\" /></div><br><br>Draginsanity is a nostalgic 2D platformer and it's easy to play:<br><br><strong>Enter fire mana fields to spit fire.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/584a2c7c1f8fcb67d343fa4c4323a789.poster.avif?t=1706563146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/584a2c7c1f8fcb67d343fa4c4323a789.webm?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/584a2c7c1f8fcb67d343fa4c4323a789.mp4?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Enter wind mana fields to fly.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/54922b202f20db7e2209e98a0ee08446.poster.avif?t=1706563146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/54922b202f20db7e2209e98a0ee08446.webm?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/54922b202f20db7e2209e98a0ee08446.mp4?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>During the game you will find even more mana fields. But beware: The mana might move and it's difficult to foresee where it will go. Explore ten stages and fight a boss at the end of every stage. Don't stop, because the screen keeps moving.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/the_story.PNG?t=1706563146\" /></div><br><br>Welcome to the magical realm Draginsanity. It is full of dragons! And it is totally insane! It used to be a world where dragons lived together in peace and harmony. But one day an evil wizard cast a spell that turned most of the dragons into evil minions. He also reduced the amount of mana in the air. The mana enabled the dragons to fly and spit fire. Without it the resistance against the wizard died quickly. All hope was lost until one day a dragon was gifted with the power to see the few remaining mana hotspots in the air and use them to his advantage.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/how_to_play.PNG?t=1706563146\" /></div><br><br>Draginsanity is a nostalgic 2D platformer and it's easy to play:<br><br><strong>Enter fire mana fields to spit fire.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/584a2c7c1f8fcb67d343fa4c4323a789.poster.avif?t=1706563146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/584a2c7c1f8fcb67d343fa4c4323a789.webm?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/584a2c7c1f8fcb67d343fa4c4323a789.mp4?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Enter wind mana fields to fly.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/54922b202f20db7e2209e98a0ee08446.poster.avif?t=1706563146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/54922b202f20db7e2209e98a0ee08446.webm?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/54922b202f20db7e2209e98a0ee08446.mp4?t=1706563146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>During the game you will find even more mana fields. But beware: The mana might move and it's difficult to foresee where it will go. Explore ten stages and fight a boss at the end of every stage. Don't stop, because the screen keeps moving.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290100/extras/the_story.PNG?t=1706563146\" /></div><br><br>Welcome to the magical realm Draginsanity. It is full of dragons! And it is totally insane! It used to be a world where dragons lived together in peace and harmony. But one day an evil wizard cast a spell that turned most of the dragons into evil minions. He also reduced the amount of mana in the air. The mana enabled the dragons to fly and spit fire. Without it the resistance against the wizard died quickly. All hope was lost until one day a dragon was gifted with the power to see the few remaining mana hotspots in the air and use them to his advantage.",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the magical realm Draginsanity. It is full of dragons! And it is totally insane! Not your usual type of platformer: The dragon can fly and spit fire - but only inside the mana fields.",
